Democratic mayoral primary in New York City
and the Republican mayoral primary in New

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:15.610
York City. There were high hopes among some
that former Democratic presidential candidate

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:22.170
Andrew Yang would do well in the Democratic
primary. Can a New York City mayoral race.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:26.690
He came out to a fast start polling really,
really well in early polls, although that

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:32.940
started to fade. Part of the belief that the
fade of Andrew Yang was because of early name

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:37.309
recognition. He jumped ahead because of early
